::GATE 2025 Set 1 Q52::[plain]Refer to the given 3-address code sequence. This code sequence is split into basic blocks. The number of basic blocks is ________. (Answer in integer) 1001\: i \= 1 1002\: j \= 1 1003\: t1 \= 10*i 1004\: t2 \= t1+j 1005\: t3 \= 8*t2 1006\: t4 \= t3-88 1007\: a[t4] \= 0.0 1008\: j \= j+1 1009\: if j <\= 10 goto 1003 1010\: i \= i+1 1011\: if i <\= 10 goto 1002 1012\: i \= 1 1013\: t5 \= i-1 1014\: t6 \= 88*t5 1015\: a[t6] \= 1.0 1016\: i \= i+1 1017\: if i <\= 10 goto 1013 {#6}
