::GATE 2024 Set 1 Q44::[plain]The symbol → indicates functional dependency in the context of a relational database. Which of the following options is/are TRUE? {~%-100%(𝑋, 𝑌) → (𝑍, 𝑊) implies 𝑋 → (𝑍, 𝑊) ~%33.33%(𝑋, 𝑌) → (𝑍, 𝑊) implies (𝑋, 𝑌) → 𝑍 ~%33.33%((𝑋, 𝑌) → 𝑍 and 𝑊 → 𝑌) implies (𝑋, 𝑊) → 𝑍 ~%33.33%(𝑋 → 𝑌 and 𝑌 → 𝑍) implies 𝑋 → 𝑍}
