::GATE 2024 Set 1 Q46::[plain]Consider the following read-write schedule 𝑆 over three transactions 𝑇1 , 𝑇2 , and 𝑇3 , where the subscripts in the schedule indicate transaction IDs\: 𝑆\: 𝑟1 (𝑧); 𝑤1 (𝑧); 𝑟2 (𝑥); 𝑟3 (𝑦); 𝑤3 (𝑦); 𝑟2 (𝑦); 𝑤2 (𝑥); 𝑤2 (𝑦); Which of the following transaction schedules is/are conflict equivalent to 𝑆 ? {~%-100%𝑇1 𝑇2 𝑇3 ~%33.33%𝑇1 𝑇3 𝑇2 ~%33.33%𝑇3 𝑇2 𝑇1 ~%33.33%𝑇3 𝑇1 𝑇2}
