::GATE 2023 Q30::[plain]Let A be the adjacency matrix of the graph with vertices \{1, 2, 3, 4, 5\}. 3 2 5 1 4 Let λ1 , λ2 , λ3 , λ4 , and λ5 be the ﬁve eigenvalues of A. Note that these eigenvalues need not be distinct. The value of λ1 + λ2 + λ3 + λ4 + λ5 \= ________. {#2}
